xt><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 158.1H294.0M31.8 204.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='102.7' y1='155.1' x2='102.7' y2='161.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='99.7' y='172.1' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='197.3' y1='155.1' x2='197.3' y2='161.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='194.3' y='172.1' font-size='10'>7</text><line x1='28.8' y1='105.0' x2='34.8' y2='105.0' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='15.8' y='109.0' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='28.8' y1='51.9' x2='34.8' y2='51.9' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='15.8' y='55.9' font-size='10'>4</text></svg></div><div class='res'>Puntos de corte: \\((1,0)\\), \\((5,0)\\) y \\((9,4)\\). El recinto está bajo la curva, sobre el eje \\(X\\) entre 1 y 5, y sobre la recta entre 5 y 9</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El suelo del recinto es el eje \\(X\\) en \\([1,5]\\) y la recta en \\([5,9]\\):</p><div class='res'>\\(A=\\displaystyle\\int_1^5\\sqrt{2x-2}\\,dx+\\int_5^9\\Bigl(\\sqrt{2x-2}-(x-5)\\Bigr)dx\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado c",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Es lo mismo que \\(\\displaystyle\\int_1^9\\sqrt{2x-2}\\,dx-\\int_5^9(x-5)\\,dx\\). Primitiva de la raíz<i class='n' data-t='th'>\\(\\int(2x-2)^{1/2}dx=\\frac{(2x-2)^{3/2}}{2\\cdot\\frac32}=\\frac13(2x-2)^{3/2}\\).</i>:</p>\\[\\int_1^9\\sqrt{2x-2}\\,dx=\\left[\\frac13(2x-2)^{3/2}\\right]_1^9=\\frac{16^{3/2}}3-0=\\frac{64}3\\]\\[\\int_5^9(x-5)\\,dx=\\left[\\frac{(x-5)^2}2\\right]_5^9=8\\]\\[A=\\frac{64}3-8=\\frac{40}3\\]<div class='res'>Área \\(=\\dfrac{40}3\\approx13{,}3333\\ u^2\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
