    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'>\\[\\overrightarrow{AB}=(-1,-3,1),\\quad\\overrightarrow{AC}=(-2,-1,1),\\quad\\overrightarrow{AD}=(1,-2,-3)\\]<p>El volumen del tetraedro es la sexta parte del valor absoluto del producto mixto<i class='n' data-t='th'>\\(|[\\vec u,\\vec v,\\vec w]|\\) es el volumen del paralelepípedo de aristas \\(\\vec u,\\vec v,\\vec w\\); el tetraedro con esas aristas es la sexta parte.</i>:</p><p>Por Sarrus<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de Sarrus: se suman los productos de la diagonal principal y de los dos triángulos con un lado paralelo a ella (en verde) y se restan los de la diagonal secundaria y sus dos triángulos (en rojo).<span style='display:block;margin:6px 0 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 206 106' width='100%' style='max-width:230px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif'><text x='0' y='30' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><text x='0' y='86' font-size='20' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><polygon points='26,10 41,25 56,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='41' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='56' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><polygon points='103,10 118,25 88,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='118' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='88' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='103' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='180,10 150,25 165,40' fill='#17a673' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='10' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='10' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='150' cy='25' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='165' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='25' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='40' r='3.6' fill='#17a673'/><circle cx='180' cy='40' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='56,66 41,81 26,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='26' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='41' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='56' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='26' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='41' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='56' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='88,66 118,81 103,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='88' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='103' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='88' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='118' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='88' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='103' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='118' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><polygon points='165,66 150,81 180,96' fill='#e8487a' fill-opacity='.15' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='150' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='66' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='180' cy='66' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='81' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/><circle cx='165' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='81' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='150' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='165' cy='96' r='2.2' fill='#9ca3af'/><circle cx='180' cy='96' r='3.6' fill='#e8487a'/></svg></span></i>:</p>\\[[\\overrightarrow{AB},\\overrightarrow{AC},\\overrightarrow{AD}]=\\begin{vmatrix}-1&-3&1\\\\-2&-1&1\\\\1&-2&-3\\end{vmatrix}\\]\\[=\\bigl(-3-3+4\\bigr)-\\bigl(-1+2-18\\bigr)\\]\\[=15\\]<div class='res'>\\(V=\\dfrac{15}6=\\dfrac52\\ u^3\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>La recta es perpendicular al plano \\(ABC\\): su director es el normal del plano<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si una recta es perpendicular a un plano, su vector director es paralelo al vector normal del plano.</i>, que es \\(\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AC}\\):</p>\\[\\overrightarrow{AB}\\times\\overrightarrow{AC}=\\begin{vmatrix}\\vec i&\\vec j&\\vec k\\\\-1&-3&1\\\\-2&-1&1\\end{vmatrix}=(-2,-1,-5)\\]<p>Tomo \\(\\vec d=(2,1,5)\\) y el punto \\(D(2,-1,-2)\\):</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":42,\"el\":22,\"p\":[[\"poly\",[[1,1,1],[0,-2,2],[-1,0,2]],\"#8b5cf6\",\"#7c3aed\"],[\"line\",[2,-1,-2],[1,1,1],\"#64748b\",1.4,true],[\"line\",[2,-1,-2],[0,-2,2],\"#64748b\",1.4,true],[\"line\",[2,-1,-2],[-1,0,2],\"#64748b\",1.4,true],[\"line\",[1.6,-1.2,-3.0],[3.6,-0.2,2.0],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[3.6,-0.2,2.0],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[2.3,-0.85,-1.25],[2.738,-0.631,-0.155],\"#16a34a\",\"d\",4,-4],[\"vec\",[0.0,0.5,1.5],[0.511,0.756,2.778],\"#dc2626\",\"n\",4,-4],[\"line\",[3.11,-0.445,0.774],[2.874,-0.269,0.833],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[2.874,-0.269,0.833],[2.765,-0.323,0.559],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"pt\",[1,1,1],\"A\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[0,-2,2],\"B\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-1,0,2],\"C\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[2,-1,-2],\"D\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[3,-0.5,0.5],\"H\",7,12]],\"ley\":[\"plano\",\"recta\",\"vector normal\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 409 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='n502n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='n502d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='n502g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0